# API Conventions

## Response wrapper

Moi API (ke ca loi) deu wrap trong ApiResponse<T>:



## Pagination

PageResponse<T> chuan, dung cho moi list API co phan trang. Mac dinh page=0, size=20, MAX_PAGE_SIZE=100, sort createdAt DESC.

## REST API semantic

| Method | Muc dich | Idempotent |
|---|---|---|
| GET    | Doc resource           | Yes |
| POST   | Tao moi / action khong idempotent | No  |
| PUT    | Replace toan bo resource | Yes |
| PATCH  | Partial update        | No* |
| DELETE | Xoa resource          | Yes |

* PATCH idempotent neu field update khong phu thuoc state hien tai.

## Quy tac

- **Khong dung POST** cho moi operation neu HTTP semantic co method phu hop.
- URL resource dung danh tu so nhieu: /api/v1/orders, /api/v1/products.
- Action dac biet dung sub-resource: /api/v1/orders/{id}/cancel.
- Versioning qua URL prefix /api/v1/.

## Versioning

Moi endpoint thuoc /api/v1/. Khi co breaking change -> danh version moi /api/v2/..., giu endpoint cu 1 release cycle (1 thang) truoc khi xoa.
